dVVMdV95WHpjSkFzb0x4Vl9EX2t4SlpPUE9ZeC1vTFprZy1YMGV1LXpJQ2ZYRFlVUjZJOERiRmhRQ1VseE42MW9ORFh0bkI2Z0V5Ym9n","elapsedMediaTimeSeconds":5},"videostatsScheduledFlushWalltimeSeconds":[10,20,30],"videostatsDefaultFlushIntervalSeconds":40},"videoDetails":{"videoId":"M8GdHdEHEeY","title":"​24 STUNNING LUXURY HOMES THAT WILL BLOW YOU AWAY | 5-Hour Interior Design Marathon","lengthSeconds":"18799","keywords":["WelcomeHome","HouseOfDreams","HomeSweetHomeTour","HomeGoalsUnlocked","InteriorMagic","LivingInStyle","TourMyHome","HomeElegance","HomeDesignInspo","HomeEnchantment","HomeWanderlust","HomeGlamour","HomeCharm","HomeDreamscapes","HousePretties","HomeJourney","HomeAesthetic","HomeTales","HomeAdventures","HouseTreasures","HomeBlissful","HomeDiaries","HomeWhispers","HomeNest","HomeSensations","HomeHues","HomeReflections","HouseWonders","HomeDelights","HomeChronicles","HouseGoals","DreamHome","HomeMakeover","InteriorInspo","HomeDesign","HomeInspiration","LuxuryLiving"],"channelId":"UCfniuqShL9VEEWgI9NiIfYQ","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"Welcome to an unforgettable luxury home tour experience! Get ready to immerse yourself in over an hour of breathtaking interior design and explore the most stunning features of high-end living. This extended video showcases multiple beautifully crafted model homes, each offering a unique blend of elegance, comfort, and modern sophistication.\n\nIn this inspiring tour, you’ll experience:\n\n✨ Gourmet Kitchens Built for Entertaining\nTour chef-worthy kitchens featuring premium appliances, custom cabinetry, and expansive islands that bring style and function together beautifully.\n\n🛏️ Luxurious Primary Suites\nStep into relaxing bedroom retreats with spa-style bathrooms, elegant finishes, and walk-in closets designed for both beauty and convenience.\n\n🛋️ Bright, Open Living Spaces\nExplore open-concept layouts that highlight natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and thoughtfully arranged furnishings that elevate every moment.\n\n🌿 Outdoor Living at Its Finest\nBe inspired by beautifully designed patios, cozy lounges, and landscaped backyards—perfect for relaxing or entertaining in style.\n\n💡 Sophisticated Interior Details\nFrom stylish lighting and high-end flooring to curated color palettes and custom design touches, every corner is full of visual delight.\n\n📱 Smart Home Integration\nSee how modern technology is effortlessly woven into these spaces, offering enhanced comfort, security, and luxury living.\n\nWhether you’re dreaming, designing, or just love exploring beautiful spaces, this long-form luxury tour is packed with ideas and inspiration.\n\nSUBSCRIBE for more incredible house tours and Decor Ideas.\n\nCheck out my channel for more eye candy!\n   / @alexluxdecor  \n\n\nCheck out my playlist!\n   • 2025 House Tours  \n\n#houses #luxuryhomes #decorideas #housedesign #hometour #home #modelhome #luxuryrealestate","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M8GdHdEHEeY/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEbCKgBEF5IVfKriqkDDggBFQAAiEIYAXABwAEG\u0026rs=AOn4CLDaUfrK1GqqSEsuohK3iLr5zmUxgw","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M8GdHdEHEeY/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEbCMQBEG5IVfKriqkDDggBFQAAiEIYAXABwAEG\u0026rs=AOn4CLAdYkKIEyWWzE_fMMwCxWXmADTgQA","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M8GdHdEHEeY/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCPYBEIoBSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==\u0026rs=AOn4CLBxCJc3w6swBjoFZ9gxcyPjSP2Svw","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M8GdHdEHEeY/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCNACELwBSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==\u0026rs=AOn4CLC6ysmUM5R2BgAGpceSCYVrTkpIhA","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/M8GdHdEHEeY/maxresdefault.webp","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"24720","author":"AlexLuxDecor","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTi