mand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAAQu2kiEwiQioDSr6iUAxUZoHwGHTwYGkDKAQS8PuLh","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse/edit_playlist"}},"playlistEditEndpoint":{"playlistId":"WL","actions":[{"action":"ACTION_REMOVE_VIDEO_BY_VIDEO_ID","removedVideoId":"M8GdHdEHEeY"}]}}}}},"storyboards":{"playerStoryboardSpecRenderer":{"spec":"https://i.ytimg.com/sb/M8GdHdEHEeY/storyboard3_L$L/$N.jpg?sqp=-oaymwENSDfyq4qpAwVwAcABBqLzl_8DBgjKwe_MBg==|48#27#100#10#10#0#default#rs$AOn4CLA2NjTnKbD46yWvXHrdVlBySIOmzA|80#45#1881#10#10#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLCC-rWJGllmbPVtoiiArxMf6W1xbg|160#90#1881#5#5#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLCj8FsiAPPh0VCi5_eNzRhHJuvu_g|320#180#1881#3#3#10000#M$M#rs$AOn4CLA1lSp64b80bWBaLIDUsdnewfKbWA","recommendedLevel":3,"fineScrubbingRecommendedLevel":2,"highResolutionRecommendedLevel":3}},"microformat":{"playerMicroformatRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M8GdHdEHEeY/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}]},"embed":{"iframeUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M8GdHdEHEeY","width":1280,"height":720},"title":{"simpleText":"​24 STUNNING LUXURY HOMES THAT WILL BLOW YOU AWAY | 5-Hour Interior Design Marathon"},"description":{"simpleText":"Welcome to an unforgettable luxury home tour experience! Get ready to immerse yourself in over an hour of breathtaking interior design and explore the most stunning features of high-end living. This extended video showcases multiple beautifully crafted model homes, each offering a unique blend of elegance, comfort, and modern sophistication.\n\nIn this inspiring tour, you’ll experience:\n\n✨ Gourmet Kitchens Built for Entertaining\nTour chef-worthy kitchens featuring premium appliances, custom cabinetry, and expansive islands that bring style and function together beautifully.\n\n🛏️ Luxurious Primary Suites\nStep into relaxing bedroom retreats with spa-style bathrooms, elegant finishes, and walk-in closets designed for both beauty and convenience.\n\n🛋️ Bright, Open Living Spaces\nExplore open-concept layouts that highlight natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and thoughtfully arranged furnishings that elevate every moment.\n\n🌿 Outdoor Living at Its Finest\nBe inspired by beautifully designed patios, cozy lounges, and landscaped backyards—perfect for relaxing or entertaining in style.\n\n💡 Sophisticated Interior Details\nFrom stylish lighting and high-end flooring to curated color palettes and custom design touches, every corner is full of visual delight.\n\n📱 Smart Home Integration\nSee how modern technology is effortlessly woven into these spaces, offering enhanced comfort, security, and luxury living.\n\nWhether you’re dreaming, designing, or just love exploring beautiful spaces, this long-form luxury tour is packed with ideas and inspiration.\n\nSUBSCRIBE for more incredible house tours and Decor Ideas.\n\nCheck out my channel for more eye candy!\n   / @alexluxdecor  \n\n\nCheck out my playlist!\n   • 2025 House Tours  \n\n#houses #luxuryhomes #decorideas #housedesign #hometour #home #modelhome #luxuryrealestate"},"lengthSeconds":"18799","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@alexluxdecor","externalChannelId":"UCfniuqShL9VEEWgI9NiIfYQ","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","