de VAT where applicable.\n\nProducts marked as ‘channel exclusive’ are listings that a merchant has shared exclusively with a specific YouTube channel. These products are discounted and/or time-limited subject to terms and conditions of the merchant. The merchant determines and is responsible for the final price and conditions of purchase, including but not limited to, warnings, recalls, disclaimers and usage information. ","textColor":4279440147},{"text":"Learn more","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI8BEMdVIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12257682?nohelpkit=1","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12257682?nohelpkit=1","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}},{"text":"\n\nYouTube is not responsible for merchant products or for the product information provided by merchants. YouTube is also not responsible for your activities and purchases made from merchants (including through the links below) which are governed by the respective merchant's terms and conditions (including their Privacy Policy). YouTube may share information with our partners to perform services, in compliance with our Privacy Policy and other appropriate confidentiality and security measures. For instance, YouTube may share your IP address with the merchant platform to facilitate the transaction. Product reviews are available in select locations only and are not verified by Google. ","textColor":4279440147},{"text":"Learn more","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI8BEMdVIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://support.google.com/googleshopping/answer/9370999?nohelpkit=1","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://support.google.com/googleshopping/answer/9370999?nohelpkit=1","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}}]},"confirmLabel":{"simpleText":"OK"},"trackingParams":"CI8BEMdVIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB"}},"popupType":"DIALOG"}},"trackingParams":"CI0BEJT0ARgBIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB"}},{"menuServiceItemRenderer":{"text":{"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"Report listing"}},"simpleText":"Report listing"},"icon":{"iconType":"FLAG"},"serviceEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4BENbYBxgTIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://accounts.google.com/ServiceLogin?service=youtube\u0026uilel=3\u0026passive=true\u0026continue=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fsignin%3Faction_handle_signin%3Dtrue%26app%3Ddesktop%26hl%3Den\u0026hl=en","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"signInEndpoint":{"nextEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4BENbYBxgTIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/flag/get_form"}},"getReportFormEndpoint":{"params":"%3D"}}}},"trackingParams":"CI4BENbYBxgTIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CI4BENbYBxgTIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","visibility":{"types":"15"},"gestures":{"types":"4"}}}}],"menuPopupAccessibility":{"label":"Actions menu"}}},"popupType":"DROPDOWN"}}}]}}},{"expandableVideoDescriptionBodyRenderer":{"showMoreText":{"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"Show more"}},"simpleText":"...more"},"showLessText":{"simpleText":"Show less"},"attributedDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Welcome to an unforgettable luxury home tour experience! Get ready to immerse yourself in over an hour of breathtaking interior design and explore the most stunning features of high-end living. This extended video showcases multiple beautifully crafted model homes, each offering a unique blend of elegance, comfort, and modern sophistication.\n\nIn this inspiring tour, you’ll experience:\n\n✨ Gourmet Kitchens Built for Entertaining\nTour chef-worthy kitchens featuring premium appliances, custom cabinetry, and expansive islands that bring style and function together beautifully.\n\n🛏️ Luxurious Primary Suites\nStep into relaxing bedroom retreats with spa-style bathrooms, elegant finishes, and walk-in closets designed for both beauty and convenience.\n\n🛋️ Bright, Open Living Spaces\nExplore open-concept layouts that highlight natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and thoughtfully arranged furnishings that elevate every moment.\n\n🌿 Outdoor Living at Its Finest\nBe inspired by beautifully designed patios, cozy lounges, and landscaped backyards—perfect for relaxing or entertaining in style.\n\n💡 Sophisticated Interior Details\nFrom stylish lighting and high-end flooring to curated color palettes and custom design touches, every corner is full of visual delight.\n\n📱 Smart Home Integration\nSee how modern technology is effortlessly woven into these spaces, offering enhanced comfort, security, and luxury living.\n\nWhether you’re dreaming, designing, or just love exploring beautiful spaces, this long-form luxury tour is packed with ideas and inspiration.\n\nSUBSCRIBE for more incredible house tours and Decor Ideas.\n\nCheck out my channel for more eye candy!\n   / @alexluxdecor  \n\n\nCheck out my playlist!\n   • 2025 House Tours  \n\n#houses #luxuryhomes #decorideas #housedesign #hometour #home #modelhome #luxuryrealestate","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1738,"length":7,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIwBENzXBBgtIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/houses","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUKCgZob3VzZXMYAQ%3D%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CIwBENzXBBgtIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB"}},{"startIndex":1746,"length":12,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIsBENzXBBguIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":