our living space. Upholstered in ultra-soft corduroy fabric, the surface provides a warm, ribbed texture that’s both visually stylish and inviting to the touch, perfectly blending comfort and modern aesthetics. Supportive Pillow Duo - This chaise lounge comes with two plush throw pillows—a larger and a smaller one—strategically designed to support your back, waist, or head as needed. Whether used individually or layered, these pillows offer customizable ergonomic comfort and help maintain a healthy, relaxed posture throughout the day. Versatile Placement for Any Interior - This oversized chaise lounge brings both elegance and comfort to any space, making it a stunning addition to living rooms, bedrooms, reading nooks, or boutique-style hotel lounges. Its sophisticated design and practical features make it a versatile choice for both contemporary and cozy interiors. Purchase instructions.1. Product color and pictures will be slightly different in different light.2. Manual measurement of the size will have an error of 1 to 2 cm. There is a size chart of our products on the picture, please check.3. Parts or hardware packaging is missing, please contact us and we will replace it for free.4. During the shipping process, it is difficult to avoid damage to the goods caused by shipping. If you are unfortunate enough to purchase a damaged product, please take a photo of the damaged product and contact us, we will replace it for you free of charge.5. If you have any questions, please contact us before you buy to avoid a series of trouble of returning and exchanging the goods. Thank you for your trust and understanding. Orren Ellis Upholstery Color: Green","price":"KES 82,763.51","vendorName":"Wayfair","trackingParams":"CDQQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CDQQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CDQQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","c