Modern Dining Chairs - Gray Fabric","productDescription":"The Reyes Coffee Table offers a striking modern contemporary design, perfect for updating your living room, den, or office space. This rectangular coffee table emphasizes clean lines and a straightforward aesthetic, enhanced by sophisticated mitered corners and a solid plinth base. Its natural Alder White wood-look finish, featuring elegant ribbed and fluted detailing, adds rich texture and tonal variation, making it a focal point in any setting. Crafted from high-quality manufactured wood (MDF and PVC materials) for both the top and base, this durable coffee table supports up to 75 pounds. Measuring 47.63 inches wide, 22 inches deep, and 15 inches high, it provides ample surface area for decor, beverages, and more. While assembly is required, all necessary tools are conveniently included, and power tools should be avoided for a smooth setup. Maintain the beauty of your Reyes coffee table with ease by simply cleaning it with a soft, dry cloth; avoid harsh chemicals or abrasive materials to preserve its pristine Alder White finish. Its easy-to-style nature makes this modern coffee table an ideal selection for a quick and impactful refresh, seamlessly blending into various decor schemes and enhancing your home's aesthetic appeal.","price":"KES 28,449.11","vendorName":"Wayfair","trackingParams":"CC8Qr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CC8Qr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CC8Qr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpKvxyeet68AZZ9kiAY9FsRh987228FkYfFBtHIfcSpuQvAxU9QFD5DZaXHWsoNqafrpUtTqTqEOcsYpkXBhl6sMU0dEtpx6oWy_Znkh6cI5jigu3XT5T_0xLeoZx7H3xJi12VAhZtZkb1VqOG7jlTDr8_UabhleaQ1ybiyQt8TnEPO1um12imy1TM4xsl-oqgoGlOnabPZdUl2kg48P-RuVbdyPNCqq8QlOJXzlimxn