rea supporting up to 40 lbs, it perfectly balances style and function. Available in White, Black, Brown, Green, Gray, Beige and Ivory finishes, its designed with fewer screws for quick and confident assembly. Wade Logan Size: 12.2\" H x 35.4\" L x 35.4\" W, Color: Black Oak","price":"KES 29,742.31","vendorName":"Wayfair","trackingParams":"CCoQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCoQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CCoQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpJTrhYdvXcbA2nAkVhMSiL05PH6MDHZ1ZKwx5UFtivzNFMowStCzPC-3CVWjY39BcHH_FjkCXkT5z_GB4urSoWkq4Zj3c_UAgr5Aaz0973qG0N1mHuq88DFcMMxO3kWgQtHuJ0ypTvLDvMDF6OyegYzjRFS1hK3qTUKi-YviBqVJUAJbZSGsj4PPtAGi2EDzbCyUKSYg0C6mr2bQKbyCV72AH3gF1uVJDej6Gvhgkgpy0aWm-YQLI94ZhPV-VLUdi4r-4mJ6VLQj6VoTpLYFBwCAm-nAJeo4LcG4Xoz_MR7rNC9_nvzqES0VoV8SxSQLsyzAmDdwLp5J00CeGYF2h7e_Al4_zuEo0T5R6hObxoVvQXcnCx19uWlALtg_AhEtZArSLMDNfWtTovEnKhIg14zK3jepzi0_VfD1IqVcunwbuTP3CU1TSAWIZQDgGEKoPGvopmk6gSvnVgbthb9zpL0UNFuJ4uO7o0PAbVYTu2dATw0H1Lofq6KQnfnw5sHhUKTAASo8afbusPpo0Vs8oxJQRs0CtbIrifdQLkuvWNgT9f5xAuyAO4bSUghb3dAVX42OmIMkGtmduhn8Jd4hDMmWDqikvterRIeJGMQBPjjBDq9oZtEztsOsTnqxwE9DlSQVShrFLk92WV8EZyVeihELjvomSDY61XkBbeLNMEljyZ_M--y3Oc0P6ROxxuUYp1keIOfKMKS-4lkMU0bHOkbwBHWVaN-clunJybdU-FTnwXX4ujGgVsSwBV2UhVQZi9LjF3uw3Ux0fuN0oYPrwbKwG2Icg"}},{"clickTrackingParams":"CCoQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.wayfair.com/Wade-Logan%C2%AE--Caomhan-Block-Coffee-Table-X122384717-L441-K~W011273606.html?refid=FR49-W011273606_154357551_160011871\u0026PiID%5B%5D=154357551\u0026PiID%5B%5D=160011871\u0026utm_content=YT3-n6aHvEdL5YpLNNlmGo2WMjgG3-JiGdIV5XlMtiTZ02yIR_nAhHgHmuDPAXnNo2UrzNGuDkPytGDj5i_Lnaj7NMr30Sh5sjI\u0026utm_medium=product_shelf