our setting. Ideal for spaces ranging from powder rooms to dressing areas, this modern-style chandelier adds a touch of opulence. Its compact size suits lower ceilings and cozy nooks. With three 11.8-inch hanging chains, the modern gold chandelier is effortless to install, Suited for kitchen, bedroom, living room, or porch use, the drum chandelier infuses a mid-century, harmonious aesthetic into your home. Elevate your large kitchen's charm by suspending multiple units above the island. Assembly is required. When illuminated, this gold drum chandelier casts captivating shadows, infusing your space with contemporary allure. Versatile and captivating, transitional chandeliers brilliantly illuminate kitchen islands, dining spaces, and entryways. Antoine Modern Dining Room 6 -Light Polished Gold Crystal Textured glass Metal Chandelier one_size | DCLW018","price":"KES 30,326.84","vendorName":"Lowe's","trackingParams":"CBsQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBsQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CBsQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpJO6L4KwKNj4HU2eJF5ZIX1VM_CUADwCNHJyXfPQxCyZW7NEM8DM6RlKwHvp1seMvZTE82zhmTU_oZYl77uDE1TogKj_ibSk6qbgSBQ0OqCkp-W1OBiXCGgFBRFU6v2pnY9AQI8jcgIxqzJZ8Wfx4sWVFEL0odXTtPHaqzQaX-_3BoSFdVm45sMY6YwHl0IucD2ih4l4T3j9y17C9K_P9g0sxw9UIG_xs1TGDM16x2YlTTIL8Fn90tFIu8hk9Rll-muIFEFs8vlcS6e63IiNIroz_abf0mveK2k1KOr-JJ7_D9eWJlqbM-ERn1TKG6f3p3KiecBXF43EHt9SKKsb00nj9POnJq6TRDIwpUJx9hRufpXA8R2qyeW3KLpxUN-LOhVewMp1_kflPn50qy6yynBastp3rUadIj6Pw-dVJnM9rCDa70K7Xv-wbPzuMdw6Gqhhp08UTsFnJA_B3bML5JvYpx6LzeZIyc8EiobMq6TzCOEPjgH1_xcFbza63ky-JvvE-z1MjEzsK60FX_XN9iGsHNqjPRgDNugD3xCBnwmbGM06cG3w86VFwoTu83rnJ6mvXpMUbTnsb6PromqeWEy4nXMRen6JqEcfMN0IItGABJ2bnNSab2uRDgb33WNuM8qrQFmZcOgW0NOT0mFsBwkyW7f45e59RxzxXN7i