eId":2,"variableType":"EKO_VARIABLE_TYPE_OUTPUT","value":{"messageValue":{"fields":[{"tag":1,"value":{"typeId":3,"constantValue":{"value":"CAE="}}}]}}}]}}}]}},"droppedProductItemDataEntityKey":"EkdGZWF0dXJlZEJhbm5lckxpdmVEcm9wcGVkUHJvZHVjdEl0ZW1EYXRhS2V5TThHZEhkRUhFZVkYibu_ASoKNTAxNTE5MDk0NyCAAygB"}},{"identifier":"GK2puAIqFFcxMDAxNjkyMDlfNDEzMzg1MzYz","featuredSegments":[{"startTimeSec":"12082","endTimeSec":"12142"}],"bannerData":{"itemData":{"productTitle":"Divo 6 - Light Dimmable LED Chandelier Ivy Bronx Shade Color: Gold","productDescription":"Illuminate your space with the Divo LED Geometric Chandelier, a modern and versatile gold finish fixture designed to elevate any room. This smart-enabled, hardwired contemporary chandelier features a unique irregular interlaced ring design, allowing you to create multiple captivating shapes from a 6-tier circular arrangement (ranging from 7.87\" to 31.49\" rings) to an avant-garde irregular mix, easily adjusted via cable locking pins. Its 118-inch adjustable metal cable ensures a perfect fit for both flat and sloped ceilings, making it an ideal statement piece for living rooms, dining areas, foyers, or commercial settings like offices and hotels. Crafted from high-quality aluminum and acrylic, this chandelier boasts a polished gold finish and a body width and height of 33.5 inches. Experience superior, energy-efficient lighting with the Divo LED Geometric Chandelier, featuring integrated LED technology with a remarkable 50,000-hour lifespan. Enjoy customizable ambiance with three color temperature options (3000K warm white, 4000K neutral white, 6000K cool white) and a remote-controlled dimming function that smoothly adjusts brightness from 10% to 100%. With an impressive integrated LED brightness of 5000-7000 Lumens, this 110V fixture provides uniform, downward light while resisting corrosion. It's smart home compatible with Ring and includes a dimmer switch, ensuring both convenience and sophisticated performance. This dry-rated fixture requires assembly and mounting, and comes with a commercial warranty for lasting assurance. Its CE, CCC, and FTS certifications underscore its quality and safety, offering a cost-effective and eco-friendly lighting solution that will enhance your home or office for years to come.","price":"KES 37,501.51","vendorName":"Wayfair","trackingParams":"CBEQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBEQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CBEQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpIM2sm80rtr8B7pQO8OBKwh6QH2BYWYCd_cGF3NqftJ1nI4UxndS2L3HHJVaXAD1sfEtjIY6tQQLZ8HUqMW5J71kAcZHpJ7LY4GdqS64TjtuGlDkNjinBvvItGwOKqCcXXL-dc4HEOjV3PmaihRtcjdQFyzo3oXmxhoViozbxPMEm-dzHhw6bU3tzhMMoTtTybOesizX8jAmgUHgLwncZdPWCUO096exxqSz0goCL9EzA0mcDUp3yUnM7envX0ckz4OLzXrjIucyaGHZpZVCZ6Dt6LZEMmFoV56uj7lwRpHu61WpVvUgbl1jcXWrKhIgCaKfj8N_u7T-pIugIy9tuCX3jN_dPryWyNzG4G69TMbxsMvTFCyEde5A0GQ0MeSyTpTstbZsUyqFXzqzrOCrol86id7japeftVn1IvrGo_lvOFi6kmX9xrpCIEJD1DcLZ7OjhlMqGcwVQIbVBexAb6p9Pm3mVmnPrGA4edn3zNjBSZRtzF_9WleeRyzDXuHgMpyDcrwGExjVhwlFe7hS9ZJITQjvkMDs-kucW_Fi0nyHRQgY63iNkSY-2kqGv25vI01qP96Qa3Yr_e855Rhuyr-7fSxHDFCGX_lmPR_d_1UUe0Z0krb5VQhixl3FVfDPtJrQl_2p6nYpZwecWmP6V-ubHFGQ1eSqIBq8VCT1EjOVHy6Tto6S7Bb3s9OKLsdX3PSdfnm6p7iCVvMwjw8bwCU-jM7ww"}},{"clickTrackingParams":"CBEQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.wayfair.com/Ivy-Bronx--Divo-LED-Geometric-Chandelier-X211270310-L6085-K~W100169209.html?refid=FR49-W100169209_413385363\u0026PiID%5B%5D=413385363\u0026utm_content=YT3-ssgTlCMFRBtpQUDd4fRoUbJucs6KkRGDdKJZqGYrwnIQbFJhl0Du3u1ys67v3uN0ruURqQHUoGVvqXirJvZKRYTvZsC3V8k\u0026utm_medium=product_shelf\u0026utm_source=youtube","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},