 features 8 E12/Candelabra light sources with tunable color temperature and full dimmability, controllable via a smart system or traditional dimmer switch, allowing you to create the perfect ambiance. Each bulb supporting rod can be rotated for precise light direction, offering unparalleled lighting customization. Experience versatile installation with an adjustable length rod, reaching up to 47.2 inches, and full compatibility with sloped ceilings. This smart-enabled chandelier, weighing 9.68 lbs, delivers ambient light and includes all necessary mounting hardware for convenience. Its robust construction ensures lasting performance, supported by a 1-year limited commercial and product warranty against defects, guaranteeing your satisfaction. Please note, this hardwired chandelier is rated for dry locations only and requires assembly by two people. Essential tools like a ladder and screwdriver are needed, and bulbs are not included. Enhance your home with this durable and stylish lighting solution.","price":"KES 16,163.71","vendorName":"Wayfair","trackingParams":"CAcQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjB","onTapCommand":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAcQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CAcQr8ILIhMIsZWA0q-olAMVWl5BAh2_FSjBygEEvD7i4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpIESzeDX5m1Z7ckdATANQWdoTi-n2zD_XpzRprCq_OaqBmLhKX8JNvoJxMEkXnYHmcso5Vx_Op36JgoxzGaW1mV_ZRlxmEAvV_9dX6md3dmeiqjV0mV9y62BKQY3nTemeSwgh01tbiYZYJmnZSzhB35CVXMfi4_B-DUhEjUlwEavkuBg38zqy9S0RBzjKhir2oQ1HDeKny8pUN-fqPp12K-ezFJwjeaRPQ1oVDvcwdJq07o1JDjqAqSaaDW4irS3fzoQpin7Og9i7XSfYrP_exyQAiV0H3ozt6ztuAavjFhk8YRDaP3vGsDva-_bRIAx9Qd-Esb8dzeMA5pkwe2iX9DV8arhyPKUbr5T7vYAy0X0g744pVJUtDr8Y8HBL_RhoqWYoKbEBCMTjxNd3can_PKECReydQt48rvtcSOjHb3_GPrA8IS5MgyFUdsssF-xacQ4n8aT1IetuDVA8TtN-fVo9GyW7ztDLRkhE5z1JwI2Am4ffwnFiNt8pr81uak-cc7VTb9b09uyO47